# discourse-sidekiq service — SAME image and variables as discourse-web
# (docker.io/bitnamilegacy/discourse:3.5.0-debian-12-r0), different start command:
#
#   /opt/bitnami/scripts/discourse/entrypoint.sh /opt/bitnami/scripts/discourse-sidekiq/run.sh
#
# No public domain. No volume. Copy every variable from discourse-web.env.sample
# (host, database, redis, S3, SMTP) — Sidekiq sends the emails and processes
# uploads, so missing SMTP/S3 vars here breaks exactly those features.
